    "title": "Timeout and Intervals in JS",
    "descriptionContent": "Learn about the asynchronous methods in JavaScript: setTimeout, setInterval and clearInterval.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17660,
        "title": "setTimeout",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JavaScript has some native methods that execute code asynchronously, such as <code>setTimeout()</code> and <code>setInterval()</code>.</p><p>In this chapter, we'll take a look at the <code>setTimeout()</code> method using game-like examples.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149752,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>setTimeout()</code> method sets a timer, in milliseconds, that executes a function or code block when the timer expires.</p><p>Code your first <code>setTimeout</code> method in the example code.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"40\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player can move now&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>setTimeout</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149753,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The code here is asynchronous. That means that while we wait for the <em>callback</em> to be executed, the code after the <code>setTimeout</code> method runs.</p><p>The console output from the <code>setTimeout</code> method will show last because of the delay.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"40\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player can move now&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>setTimeout</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149754,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>delay</code> parameter is the time, in milliseconds, that passes before the function or code block executes.</p><p>In the following code, set a <code>2000</code> millisecond delay for the code block to execute.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up charging&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ready after 2 seconds&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Keep playing while it charges&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>2000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149755,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setTimeout()</code> is always asynchronous, even if the <code>delay</code> parameter is omitted or we set it as <code>0</code>.</p><p>With a <code>delay</code> of <code>0</code>, the code after the <code>setTimeout()</code> method executes immediately, but the callback function is executed as <em>soon as possible</em>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame start&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Deferred UI update (runs asap)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame end&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149756,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setTimeout()</code> executes the <code>callback</code> after the specified <code>delay</code>.</p><p>The code <em>after</em> the <code>setTimeout</code> continues to execute regardless of whether a callback or code block is used.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"120\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned after delay&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(spawnEnemy, \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player exploring...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>spawnEnemy</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149757,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What statement is true regarding JavaScript methods?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">JavaScript has some methods that execute code asynchronously</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">JavaScript only has methods that execute code synchronously</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">JavaScript has some methods that execute code asynchronously.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149758,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does the <code>setTimeout()</code> method do?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It executes a callback function when a timer expires</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It only sets a timer</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It executes a callback function when a timer expires.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149759,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What statement is true regarding the <code>setTimeout()</code> method?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It is an asynchronous JavaScript method</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It is a synchronous JavaScript method</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It is an asynchronous JavaScript method.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149760,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does the <code>delay</code> parameter of <code>setTimeout()</code> do?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It specifies how many milliseconds pass before the callback is executed</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It causes all of the code to stop executing</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It specifies how many milliseconds pass before the callback is executed.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149761,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's the default value of the <code>delay</code> parameter when we don't pass a value to it?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">0 milliseconds</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1000 milliseconds</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">0 milliseconds.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149762,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When is the callback function of <code>setTimeout()</code> executed?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">After the timer set by the <code>delay</code> parameter expires</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Before the timer set by the <code>delay</code> parameter expires</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">After the timer set by the <code>delay</code> parameter expires.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149763,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the <code>setTimeout()</code> method to complete the code.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"204\" endIndex=\"214\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"simulateBattle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// battle logic\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// updates `score` variable\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score += \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"simulateBattle();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Battle processing...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"`Score updated to \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"9000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can open your inventory while waiting.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>setTimeout</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 149764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code an <code>8000</code> millisecond delay in the <code>setTimeout()</code> method.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"249\" endIndex=\"253\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"simulateBattle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// battle logic\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// updates `score` variable\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score += \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"simulateBattle();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Battle processing...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"`Score updated to \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"8000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can open your inventory while waiting.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>8000</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 149765,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the code so that the callback function executes as soon as possible.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"113\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame start&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Deferred collision check, even with no delay&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame end&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 149766,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the callback function that prints the result of <code>simulateBattle()</code>, for the first parameter of <code>setTimeout()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"265\" endIndex=\"274\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"simulateBattle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// battle logic\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"// updates `score` variable\" class=\"comment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score += \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"simulateBattle();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Battle processing...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = \" /><text value=\"`Score updated to \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(showScore, \" /><text value=\"5000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can open your inventory while waiting.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>showScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17661,
        "title": "setInterval and clearInterval",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149767,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval()</code> is another native JavaScript method that executes code asynchronously.</p><p>With <code>setInterval</code> we can run a tiny part of a game loop every set period of time. Let's learn more about this method.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval()</code> takes a callback function and an interval as parameters. Here, <code>toggleInvincibility</code> switches the player's invincibility on and off.</p><p>Pass the callback function and the interval to the <code>setInterval</code> call.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"217\" endIndex=\"228\" /><option startIndex=\"229\" endIndex=\"248\" /><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"253\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toggleInvincibility = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isInvincible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility on&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(toggleInvincibility, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>setInterval</code>, followed by <code>toggleInvincibility</code>, and finally <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149769,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>setInterval</code> executes the callback function forever, with a delay of the specified number of milliseconds we pass as the second parameter.</p><p>The first execution of the callback occurs after the time specified. It doesn't execute immediately.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"253\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toggleInvincibility = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isInvincible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility off&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invincibility on&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isInvincible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(toggleInvincibility, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If we run the code we might get a timeout error because there's no stop to the <code>setInterval</code>.</p><p>Add <code>500</code> milliseconds here to see the power-up blink forever every <code>500</code> milliseconds!</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"215\" endIndex=\"218\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To stop <code>setInterval()</code> from running indefinitely, we can use the <code>clearInterval</code> method.<br /></p><p>We can save the <code>setInterval</code> in a <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code> variable. Then use <code>clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval)</code> inside a <code>setTimeout</code> to be executed after <code>2500</code> milliseconds.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"268\" endIndex=\"281\" /><option startIndex=\"282\" endIndex=\"302\" /><option startIndex=\"340\" endIndex=\"344\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUpBlinkInterval = setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ended&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>let</code> followed by <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code> and then <code>clearInterval</code>, <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>, <code>2500</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>clearInterval()</code> method takes the <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code> as its sole parameter.</p><p>On execution, it stops the repeating action of the <code>setInterval()</code> method.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"268\" endIndex=\"281\" /><option startIndex=\"282\" endIndex=\"302\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" powerUpBlinkInterval = setInterval(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPowerUpVisible) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up hidden&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up visible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  isPowerUpVisible = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(powerUpBlinkInterval);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up ended&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"2500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>clearInterval</code>, followed by <code>powerUpBlinkInterval</code>.</p></body></html>"
